  "description": "Teamfight Tactics units that League of Legends does not have, for Teamfight Manager 2: Powder, Norra, Alune, Silco, Maddie, Loris, Kobuko, Vander, Violet, Krug, Ao Shin, Scar, Renni, Smeech, Sevika, Steb, Nomsy, Idas. Powder's, Alune's and Silco's kits are our own designs, drawn from TFT and Arcane; Norra's follows League of Legends: Wild Rift (what the data cannot play is the pack's own code, tft.dll). Sharper frames when the League of Legends Heroes pack (league) is also enabled. Non-commercial fan project; Teamfight Tactics, Wild Rift and Arcane (c) Riot Games.",
